But strings.Fields splits on any whitespace (including newlines, tabs). "首尾空白被去掉" and "连续空白折成一个连字符". `strings.Fields` + Join handles exactly that. And ToLower for lowercase.

Hmm, but what about "Hello World" → "hello-world" requires lowercase. The issue title says Slug. So yes lowercase.

What about hyphens in input? Not specified. Keep minimum. Use Fields approach — simplest.

